              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కుదుర్చు (kudurcu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 1709 lists Telugu kudurcu beside kuduru, \"to become settled, to be adjusted or arranged\", with Tamil kutir, \"to be settled\"."
            }
